    {
      "source_id": "issue-575-stage-a-joint-fit",
      "citation": "ePC-SAFT issue 575 stage-A native joint fit, 2026-10-16",
      "use_basis": "Unqualified stage-A candidate: Na+, Mg2+ and Ca2+ refit jointly on Hamer-Wu NaCl, Goldberg-Nuttall MgCl2/CaCl2 (<= 3.3 mol/kg), Rard-Miller 1987 NaCl-MgCl2 and Saad-Padova-Marcus 1980 NaCl-KCl-CaCl2 mixture osmotic coefficients at 298.15 K on held-2014-strategy2/2; water, Cl-, K+, Li+ and every u_i unchanged. Held-out water properties under the frozen #556 limits, Dinane-Mounir judged by source agreement (owner amendment 2026-10-16: per realization, the larger of the frozen limit and the Rard-Miller/Dinane-Mounir disagreement) (RMS/max, robust over 1,467 realizations): robinson-bower-1966 I<=3 0.0105/0.0189 fail (0/1,467 realizations pass; failing: 1467 realizations); robinson-bower-1966 I>3 0.0097/0.0183 pass; dinane-mounir-2003 I<=3 0.0008/0.0016 fail (1,466/1,467 realizations pass; failing: r1408); dinane-mounir-2003 I>3 0.0014/0.0024 pass. 298.15 K only; no K+/Li+ mixture, temperature or physical-validation claim."
    }
